   "boundElements": [],
   "text": "The inventory's most useful output is not what exists \u2014 it\nis what does not. Over a few adoptions this becomes a\nprioritized, evidence-backed statement of what the\nproject's tooling is missing, ordered by how many\npractices wanted it.\n\nIt arrives for free. Nobody maintains it by hand.",
